      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `7ccc208997d0d5a25eba207e0e5a89ab17e430fe529cf594a8f9e71cdc6deee2--criminal-courts-australia-2010-11-cube-7-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6e861d803f633f33757f49950b495419ce602ba26091a6f7f5e5bb1164362f3b | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 03d207177982b8b867084ef37e0f34fd37d1e60bdcf3ccbea96b9484fe3fed01 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | be47abc5faea51f995b214ca06654734db871783f3e007520e0886a0f5f47b7d | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 2cd7464945bd7ea57429821ae290b92dc8b6df66544f1a05f3ae89de5f722bf7 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | aca4917bc6b01c912d1a763aa04cf631a47745bfd6277897d7602c0707a1d163 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | e2d507e880659defb0292366ae46c9d640022d9ab1a39ffd00f5f6d6677c194e | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
